The '''Great Beanstalk''' is a sub-location of the {{zone|Dreadfarm}} in the [[Rift Dimension]].

== Purpose ==
The '''Great Beanstalk''' starts as a small sprout, needing to be watered with a {{Item|Plumber's Bucket}}. After being watered, any players in the zone must move into the safe zone, indicated by green particles, to allow the sprout to grow and place more bulbs at the top. This happens multiple times before the '''Great Beanstalk''' reaches its full height and spawns an [[Enigma Soul]] at the top.

